msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnSecurityRingClosure|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gmn envelope security-ring closure"
msgstr "gmn 信封安全环闭合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnSecurityRingClosure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The class-scoped closed-world authority requiring every gmeow:GmnEnvelope to carry gmeow:gmnSecurityRing; its paired universal restriction fixes the value type without creating an existential witness."
msgstr "以类为作用域的闭世界权威：要求每个 gmeow:GmnEnvelope 都携带 gmeow:gmnSecurityRing；与之配对的全称限制固定了取值类型，而不产生存在性见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnEnvelopeCorrespondenceClosure|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gmn envelope correspondence closure"
msgstr "gmn 信封对应闭合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnEnvelopeCorrespondenceClosure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The class-scoped closed-world authority requiring every gmeow:GmnEnvelope to carry gmeow:gmnEnvelopeCorrespondence; its paired universal restriction fixes the value type without creating an existential witness."
msgstr "以类为作用域的闭世界权威：要求每个 gmeow:GmnEnvelope 都携带 gmeow:gmnEnvelopeCorrespondence；与之配对的全称限制固定了取值类型，而不产生存在性见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnRingLevelClosure|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gmn ring level closure"
msgstr "gmn 环级别闭合"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnRingLevelClosure|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The class-scoped closed-world authority requiring every gmeow:GmnSecurityRing to carry gmeow:gmnRingLevel; its paired universal restriction fixes the value type without creating an existential witness."
msgstr "以类为作用域的闭世界权威：要求每个 gmeow:GmnSecurityRing 都携带 gmeow:gmnRingLevel；与之配对的全称限制固定了取值类型，而不产生存在性见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnSecurityRingFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gmnSecurityRing is functional"
msgstr "gmnSecurityRing 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnSecurityRingFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gmnSecurityRing is functional: a gmeow:GmnEnvelope names exactly one admission ring, because the ring IS the single boundary class the serializer checked the payload against — two rings on one envelope would leave the admission decision undetermined. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gmnSecurityRing 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:GmnEnvelope 恰好命名一个准入环，因为该环正是序列化器据以校验有效载荷的唯一边界类——同一信封上出现两个环会使准入判定悬而未决。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gmnSecurityRingFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:gmnSecurityRing and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:gmnSecurityRing (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：本记录只承载关于 gmeow:gmnSecurityRing 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:gmnSecurityRing 的定义（定义位于该术语自身之上），不是形状，也不是第二处陈述该术语含义的地方——与其扩大本记录，不如将其退役。"
